Key Takeaways
The DevOps lifecycle is a continuous feedback loop, not a one-time sequence.
Each phase feeds into the next and is heavily automated.
Monitoring provides insights that influence future planning.
A successful DevOps implementation relies on automation, collaboration, and continuous improvement across all stages.
